# Eclipsed Merrow: "When this creature enters, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a Merfolk, Plains, or Island card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." (CR 701.20a, 401.4) The top four are Sandbar Merfolk, Plains, Island and Swamp; the fifth, a Swamp, is not looked at.
